~ unreachable

$> guide.point_at_subject("Nobody can reach this")
sai: Administrator. Nobody can walk to the {{ guide.subject_name() }}.
sai: A module is only useful if a crew member can get to its door. Right now that one is sealed off from the rest of the station.
sai: Corridors and stairs are in Build, under Core. They are prefabricated - they land finished, no construction, no materials.
sai: Run a line from something the crew already use, and it will start working.
=> END
